<title>USA: United Energy sets distribution.</title>
<headline>United Energy sets distribution.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Energy Corp said Thursday it entered into a distribution agreement with Liberty Operating Co for the marketing of its KH-30 Compound in West Texas.</p>
<p>Liberty began selling KH-30 Compound in the first week of January and expects to enhance product sales significantly in February by treating selected wells of several large independent oil and gas operators.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
